#: 6df1549510024fae9483283822103fff
msgid "Updating"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:332
#: 10e7605f20ac474386e23903f9a933b4
msgid ""
"Next, :doc:`update </user/how-to-guides/how-to-update>` your installation to "
"ensure you have the latest security updates. Frequently updating is one of "
